  "title": "cppcheck: add libraries for some WS macros",
  "description": "Create very basic \"library\" file for cppcheck so it recognizes some of\nour most common macros and won't skip checking files that have them.\n\nAlso tell cppcheck to use the gtk (ie, GLib) and qt libraries, so it\nknows about the functions from there we use.\n\n[skip ci]\n\nCloses #20081",
